/// A project's root is instantiated with `packageUsing:` and a manifest of
/// the project's other modules, each answered by its id, which is the name
/// its source declares for a module without :module: metadata
/// (docs/design/modules.md). Each module definition is a
/// class (§6.4), instantiated here with whatever its own factory takes; the
/// platform reaches the program only through main:args: (§8.4).
class App packageUsing: manifest = Object new (
  |
    private Greeting = manifest at: 'Greeting'.
    private Counter = manifest at: 'Counter'.
  |
) (
  public main: platform args: arguments = (
    |
      counter = Counter new.
    |
    counter
        bump;
        bump.
    platform transcript
        show: (Greeting named: 'modules') text;
        newLine;
        show: counter count printString;
        newLine.
  )
)
